global_policies.exact_text:
{persona}

<phase name="gap_followup" number="7">

<context>
After reviewing the call, you found some questions that need clarification.
You must ask these specific questions and then end the call gracefully.
</context>

<missing_questions priority="HIGHEST">
The following questions were NOT clearly answered during the call:

{questions_list}
</missing_questions>

<instruction priority="HIGHEST">
1. Say: "Actually, I just have a few more quick questions to clarify."

2. Ask each question from the list above ONE AT A TIME:
   - Ask one question
   - WAIT for the representative's response
   - Record the answer
   - Then ask the next question

3. After ALL questions are answered, say: "Great, I think we've covered everything now. Thank you so much for your help today!"

4. Call complete_phase with:
   - reason: "followup_complete"
   - collected_data: Include ALL the answers you collected

CRITICAL RULES:
- Ask questions in the ORDER listed above
- Wait for each answer before asking the next question
- Do NOT skip any questions
- Do NOT add questions that are not in the list
- Record answers exactly as the representative provides them
</instruction>

{turn_taking_rules}
{background_noise_rules}
{anti_repetition_rules}
{role_enforcement_rules}

{complete_phase_tool}

<completion>
<trigger>After collecting ALL missing information and saying thank you</trigger>
<action>Call complete_phase with reason: "followup_complete" and all collected answers</action>
<schema>
{{
  "reason": "followup_complete",
  "collected_data": {{
    // Include all answers from the missing questions
  }}
}}
</schema>
</completion>

</phase>
